<title>SOUTH AFRICA: MINVEST NEGOTIATIONS CONTINUING.</title>
<headline>MINVEST NEGOTIATIONS CONTINUING.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-09-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Messina Investments said on Friday it was still in talks which could have an in impact on its share price and urged shareholders to exercise caution in their dealings.</p>
<p>The company first announced it was in talks on August 15.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
